SUMMARY:Sun Circle: Virgo Season
DESCRIPTION:Senseful Soul’s Asheville Healing Community🧘🏻‍♀️
 🏳️‍🌈🪐🔮\nJoin us for an intentional ritual for Virgo season
 \nWhen the sun moves into a new sign an energetic shift occurs. Learning t
 o connect\, listen\, and set intentions with the sun is a beautiful way to
  add ritual into your life.\nVirgo season is from 8/23 - 9/22 and for this
  gathering we'll discuss the Astrological happenings of the zodiac season 
 and where it will impact you personally (birth chart recommended).\nAs wit
 h all energetic shifts\, getting into your body is important. Together we'
 ll ground into the energy through meditation and movement themed around th
 e season. Accommodations/Modification can be made for ALL bodies\, come as
  you are.\nWe'll close out with time for journaling and optional sharing.\
 nDonation Recommend: $15-20
